            "prompt_template": [
              {
                "role": "system",
                "text": "You are an intelligent query router for a multi-agent system. Analyze the user's query and determine which agents should be involved based on their capabilities.\n\nAvailable agents: {{#start.available_agents#}}\nAgent capabilities: {{#start.agent_capabilities#}}\n\nFor each query, determine:\n1. Which agents are needed (research, analysis, code, or combination)\n2. The priority/order of agent involvement\n3. The reasoning for your decision\n\nRespond with a JSON object containing:\n- selected_agents: array of agent names\n- reasoning: explanation of why these agents were chosen\n- execution_order: suggested order of agent execution"
              },
              {
                "role": "user",
                "text": "User query: {{#start.user_input#}}"
              }
            ],
            "selected": false,
            "title": "Analyze Query",
            "type": "llm",
            "variables": [
              {
                "value_selector": [
                  "start",
                  "user_input"
                ],
                "variable": "user_input"
              },
